---
function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const p1 = [x2 - 9 * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - 9 * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - 9 * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - 9 * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}
const W = 900, H = 252;
---
<figure class="bep1b">
  <div class="bep1b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="How the resolver looks up a name: it asks the cache first, then the router, then the DNS hierarchy, and caches every answer for its TTL.">
    <rect x="20" y="95" width="185" height="64" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="30" y="120" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>curl asks for an IP</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>curl hỏi địa chỉ</tspan></text>
    <text x="30" y="142" class="m">fastapi.tiangolo.com</text>
    {(() => { const a = arrow(205, 127, 249, 127); return <g><path d={a.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={a.head} class="hd" /></g>; })()}
    <rect x="255" y="95" width="165" height="64" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="340" y="120" text-anchor="middle" class="t">resolver</text>
    <text x="340" y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>asks around for you</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đi hỏi giúp bạn</tspan></text>
    {(() => { const a = arrow(420, 112, 539, 50); return <g><path d={a.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={a.head} class="hd" /></g>; })()}
    <rect x="545" y="18" width="335" height="56" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="560" y="42" class="t">cache</text>
    <text x="560" y="64" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>asked first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hỏi đầu tiên</tspan></text>
    {(() => { const a = arrow(560, 74, 560, 88); return <g><path d={a.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={a.head} class="hd" /></g>; })()}
    <text x="574" y="85" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>miss</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chưa có</tspan></text>
    <rect x="545" y="92" width="335" height="56" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="560" y="116" class="t">router</text>
    <text x="560" y="138" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>asked next</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hỏi kế tiếp</tspan></text>
    {(() => { const a = arrow(560, 148, 560, 162); return <g><path d={a.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={a.head} class="hd" /></g>; })()}
    <text x="574" y="159" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>miss</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chưa có</tspan></text>
    <rect x="545" y="166" width="335" height="56" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="560" y="190" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>the DNS hierarchy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cây DNS</tspan></text>
    <text x="560" y="212" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>asked last</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hỏi sau cùng</tspan></text>
    <path d="M 545 194 C 495 196 460 185 438 166" class="ret" />
    {(() => { const a = arrow(441, 169, 435, 162); return <polygon points={a.head} class="hdr" />; })()}
    <text x="480" y="240" text-anchor="middle" class="rl"><tspan data-lang-en>every answer is cached for its TTL</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>câu trả lời nào cũng được lưu theo TTL</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The resolver always asks in the same order — cache first, then the router, then the hierarchy — and remembers every answer for its TTL.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Resolver luôn hỏi theo đúng thứ tự — cache trước, router kế tiếp, rồi cả cây DNS — và nhớ lại từng câu trả lời theo TTL của nó.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep1b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep1b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep1b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep1b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep1b .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep1b .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep1b .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep1b .rl { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .bep1b .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep1b .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep1b .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep1b .ret { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep1b .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep1b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
